[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Assassination</h2>
<i>"Friendships are only for the manipulation of others."<br>
--Lord Azur, Keeper of the Tome</i>  
<p>For years you have been oppressed in your guild, so you decided it was time for action. During the night, you crept into the evil guild master's palace with a knife strapped to your belt. But as you were about to bring it down on him, he put up his shield and you were forced to escape on an island. Furious, the guild master has sent two of his most trusted henchmen to bring him your head. Kill them.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You are free from the guild's grip. Now it is time for revenge...
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,attackfortress

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Well Done!</h2>
<p>
The Thunder Master is dead, destroy the Rain Master and be free of the guild!

[ai3PriestDead]
